#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:23 fdf33a8d4f8643b8b9c4aa50d48af06a
msgid ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D is a 3D node that plays :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` "
"resources using the FMOD audio engine. It provides full 3D spatial audio capabilities including "
"distance attenuation, doppler effect, and directional emission."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D 使用 FMOD 播放  :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`  "
"资源，支持三维距离衰减、多普勒效果和定向发声。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:25 55edaf528eb34e228005a659193d4fa9
msgid "Key features:"
msgstr "主要特性："

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:27 4a25535bf608482881e6b713c0759e55
msgid "Full 3D spatial audio with configurable attenuation models"
msgstr "它适合环境声源、角色语音、机器声、移动物体声源等需要空间定位的音频"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:29 92bb1127371b4be1868f5992adf3d093
msgid "Doppler effect support with velocity tracking"
msgstr "通过速度跟踪支持多普勒效果"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:31 03c7aabe04d04ad3a02acb30f9b88a1a
msgid "Directional emission cone for focused sound projection"
msgstr "通过定向发声锥控制声音方向"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:33 6b323e66bfdd44c0b3bf4e85e19e7a1d
msgid "Distance-based filtering (air absorption simulation)"
msgstr "基于距离的滤波，用于模拟空气吸收"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:35 86bf914e1e224e188094e0e140702054
msgid "Multiple attenuation models (inverse, inverse square, linear, disabled)"
msgstr "支持反比、平方反比、线性和禁用等衰减模型"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:37 28d29f7f2aa94f3c824a0315d86ecc0c
